Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:26.36,Credit,,0,0,0,,Whip  @whipcampaigns\NCNN's Harry Enten\NSource: CNN News Central, Nov. 20, 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.08,0:00:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There is this worry that Dems will focus\Ntoo much on investigating
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the Trump administration, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, all those investigations\Nthat a lot of Democrats have promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the voters will take\Nsome investigations, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, corruption was high up\Non the list of issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But look at this. We're talking about\Ntwo in three voters,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,two in three Americans,\N67 percent of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,say that they are, in fact, worried\Nthat Democrats will do too much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,investigating of, in fact,\Nthe Trump administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And even among Democratic\Nand Democratic leaders,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,it's nearly a majority\Nat 49 percent.
